  "key_concepts": [
    "Circle TOP generates filled circles, ellipses, arcs, and N-sided polygons.",
    "Radius and center units can be pixels, fraction, or fraction aspect depending on parameter choice.",
    "Fill, border, background, and alpha controls are independent.",
    "Arc angles cut out a region of the circle rather than only rotating a full disk.",
    "Polygon mode uses the X radius to define the polygon and preserves the requested side count.",
    "It can composite the generated shape over an input using blend operation controls."
